{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","亡血恩赐"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Crimson Blessing"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，将布阵在身前1格的友军转化为“吸血鬼眷属”。主动释放时，召唤鲜血法阵对敌人造成伤害。（不用翻译）"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，苔佩希消耗自身10%生命值将布阵在身前1格的友军转化为“吸血鬼眷属”。“眷属”的攻击距离强制降低至1，受到非亡灵眷族的治疗减少90%，但获得苔佩希40% + 4%初始攻击力，40% + 4%初始生命值和25% + 2%伤害减免，每秒失去3%生命值并等量治疗苔佩希。“眷属”存活时，苔佩希造成伤害的30% + 3%会转化为对自身和“眷属”的治疗。主动使用时，苔佩希消耗10%当前生命值，以“眷属”为中心展开持续6秒的鲜血法阵，每秒对周围2格的敌人造成64% + 8% ATK伤害，并在结束时额外造成320% + 40% ATK真实伤害，法阵持续期间，范围内敌人每损失10%生命值便生成1颗血珠，最多生成12颗，每颗血珠会使法阵结束伤害提升10%。当生成不少于3颗血珠时，会使“眷属”进入8秒“鲜血渴望”状态，提升40 + 4点急速和50 + 5点汲取。战场上不存在“眷属”时，苔佩希会以自身作为技能目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Tephesia sacrifices 10% of her HP to turn the ally positioned 1 tile in front of her into a vampire thrall. The thrall's attack range is set to 1 tile, and it receives 90% less healing from non-Graveborn allies. It gains 40% + 4% of Tephesia's initial ATK, 40% + 4% of her initial HP, and 25% + 2% DMG Reduction. Each second, the thrall loses 3% of its HP and heals Tephesia for the same amount. While the thrall is alive, 30% + 3% of the damage Tephesia deals is converted into healing for both of them.\nActive. Tephesia sacrifices 10% of her current HP to deploy a blood circle around her thrall for 6s. Each second, enemies within 2 tiles take 64% + 8% ATK damage. When the circle expires, they take an extra 320% + 40% ATK true damage. Each time an enemy within the circle loses 10% of its HP, 1 blood orbs are generated, up to a maximum of 12. Each blood orb increases the damage dealt when the circle expires by 10%. Once at least 3 orbs have been generated, the thrall enters Bloodlust state for 8s, gaining 40 + 4 Haste and 50 + 5 Life Drain. If there is no thrall on the battlefield, Tephesia targets herself with this skill."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":82,"end":87,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":96,"end":101,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":110,"end":115,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":157,"end":162,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":233,"end":238,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":258,"end":264,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"},{"start":363,"end":367,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg16"},{"start":373,"end":377,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg17"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":246,"end":251,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":282,"end":287,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":314,"end":319,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":448,"end":453,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":672,"end":677,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":738,"end":744,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"},{"start":1039,"end":1043,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg16"},{"start":1056,"end":1060,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg17"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":230,"end":242,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":254,"end":268,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":669,"end":681,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":734,"end":748,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至68% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the blood circle's damage per second to 68% + 8% ATK and the true damage it deals when it expires to 340% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"